"P3162583816" "Good work in smoking out the traitor. Our interrogators are hard at work to get to the bottom of the matter, but now you need to cement just how serious this offence is.<br><br>We've located a Resistance hideout in a warehouse in Industry Avenue. We have no idea if they are connected to the group that attacked you, but we're sure a connection will come to light in time.<br><br>Plant this in the hideout to validate all the hard work you've done in the name of the Emperor."

