// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P2571724195" "You heard it here first, TPN viewers. In a word, 'Amazing!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3904113332" "Being a member of the powers division is, as we both know, all about the stardom. You might be a hero to the people, but what really matters is the tangible benefits of being a symbol for the little people to stare up at. The best way to skyrocket into the lime light is to make sure the light is pointed at yourself whenever you do something note worthy. You make your own luck in this world. So what do you say, interested in earning a little ratings boost?"
// SendOffString :
"P38966421" "You can't get on top without a little help, and we expect some in return. We're going to make you the biggest thing next to Marcus Cole himself. All you have to do is activate a beacon we had planted for you in the middle of People's Park, then wait until the city needs you. Just make sure you show up first, okay? Getting that beacon wasn't easy."

