// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1437390643" "Imperial City Saved"
// DetailString :
"P350952020" "The plan worked flawlessly. You and the other Powers Division members donned your 'Resistance' disguises, rampaged across Imperial City, made a mockery of the PPD, destroyed property, and injured a number of weakling citizens. If that wasn't fun enough, you then removed your disguise and arrived to save the day. You took down the 'Resistance' in a staged street brawl that appeared to rival the legendary exploits of Marauder, and then disarmed some nasty explosives 'they' had planted. The people adore you, and will demand greater freedoms and a bigger budget for the Powers Division to combat the Resistance terrorists."

