"P3597560447" "We've gotten word that the PPD have just raided Athena Labs to arrest Director Conway for charges of conspiracy to spread false information and support anti-government radicals. Conway has been creating 'truth diskettes' and distributing them to the Resistance. We want you to find those diskettes and confiscate them."
// SendOffString :
"P3092094249" " If we know the Resistance at all, they'll make a play to try and rescue Conway as well. Make sure that doesn't happen."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3309244959" "Confiscate Resistance Propaganda"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P515676385" "You still need to get that thing for me."

