// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2798457843" "Hello. I've got some information for you."
// Answer Text :
"P1939340389" "Ask about information."
// Answer Text :
"P1195468855" "Ask about the weather."
// Answer Text :
"P1250699819" "Threaten to beat informant"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3447255354" "This world is full of super villains. They want to do evil things like take over the world."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1407234927" "I think it's going to rain tomorrow."
// Answer Text :
"P1443913718" "Try again."
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P1781926359" "Alright, Alright. I'll tell you everything I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - IncriminatingEvidenceClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P752610817" "Incriminating Evidence"
// DetailString :
"P3146680647" "You need to plant this evidence wherever you arrest Donovan Green. When the PPD investigators show up, they'll find it and further seal Green's fate. If traitors are going to work outside the law, then so shall you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BombClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3389681911" "You need to plant this partially completed bomb wherever you arrest Donovan Green. When the PPD investigators show up they'll find it and it will further seal Green's fate. If traitors are going to work outside the law, then so shall you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DonovanGreenClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3278851552" "Donovan Green"
// DetailString :
"P2347429262" "By looking at him you wouldn't suspect that Donovan Green was a terrorist fighting to bring down the unified free world, but then again, that's how he has lasted so long without getting caught. It just goes to show you, everyone is a suspect."

